sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Operator (acme)
    participant API as REST API
    participant Sec as SecurityFilterChain
    participant Svc as SearchService
    participant OS as OpenSearch
    participant CH as ClickHouse

    U->>API: POST /search { q: "*" } + JWT
    API->>Sec: JWT verify + extract tenant claim
    Note over Sec: claim.tenant_id = "acme"
    Sec->>Svc: inject OperatorContext(tenant=acme)
    Svc->>Svc: query rewrite — q AND tenantId:acme
    par OpenSearch path
        Svc->>OS: GET events-acme-read/_search
        Note over OS: alias points only to acme indices (1)
    and ClickHouse path
        Svc->>CH: SET tenant_id='acme' then SELECT ...
        Note over CH: Row Policy keeps only matching rows (2)
    end
    Note over U,CH: another tenant (globex) is blocked at all 4 layers
